
# Safety net: `ui/public` is copied verbatim into the SPA bucket, so an Improve bundle
# here would ship to staging as a public, unauthenticated, un-filtered file. The surface
# no longer reads a static file at all — it fetches the bundle through the authenticated
# `/improve/data` proxy route, backed by the DynamoDB Improve store. Emit the wire payload
# to a scratch path outside public/ and seed it with `improve.seed_snapshot`, e.g.:
#   cd agent && uv run python -m improve.mine_local --emit-wire ../tests/evaluation/experiments/improve-wire.json
#   cd agent && uv run python -m improve.seed_snapshot --bundle ../tests/evaluation/experiments/improve-wire.json --table mediaworks-harness-improve
# This entry stays so an accidental regeneration to the old location never gets committed.
public/improve-data.json
